14--> BEST PRACTICES
      -->1. Never use the root account
	  -->2. Set up IAM Users/Groups
	  -->3. Multi Factor Authentication Everywhere
	  -->4. Follow Principle of Least Privilege:
	        -->Don't give Administator Access to everyone.
			-->Instead, create narrow policies (e.g., allow ECE2 but deny IAM chnages).
			
			


